### 获取所有菜品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes
Accept: application/json

### 创建新菜品
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "宫保鸡丁",
  "price": 38.00,
  "description": "经典川菜，麻辣鲜香",
  "category": "热菜",
  "imageUrl": "kungpao.jpg",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 根据ID获取菜品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/1
Accept: application/json

### 按分类查询
#GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/category/热菜
#Accept: application/json
### 按分类查询（使用URL编码）之前的400，中文编码问题
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/category/%E7%83%AD%E8%8F%9C
Accept: application/json

### 更新菜品
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "宫保鸡丁（大份）",
  "price": 45.00,
  "description": "经典川菜，麻辣鲜香 - 大份装",
  "category": "热菜",
  "imageUrl": "kungpao-large.jpg",
  "isAvailable": true
}



### 创建菜品 - 验证失败案例（名称为空）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -10.00,
  "category": ""
}

### 测试分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/page?page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json

### 测试第二页
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/page?page=1&size=3
Accept: application/json

### 测试验证功能 - 错误数据
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -10.00,
  "category": ""
}

### 测试验证功能 - 正确数据
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "麻婆豆腐",
  "price": 28.00,
  "description": "麻辣可口，下饭神器",
  "category": "热菜",
  "imageUrl": "mapotofu.jpg",
  "isAvailable": true
}
### 删除菜品
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/dishes/3